SUMMARY:SPECIMEN: Science Fiction on Stage
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHi all\,\n\nWe've been invited to see an
  original sci-fi play called SPECIMEN at Axis Theatre Company in Greenwich
  Village with discounted tickets for just $10!\n.\nWritten and directed by
  Randall Sharp\, SPECIMEN takes place aboard a damaged research spacecraft
 \, where a crew struggles to make sense of their new reality. TheaterScene
  calls it a "... darkly absurd sci-fi fever dream…" that "...arrives lik
 e a transmission from a dying satellite: garbled\, abrasive\, funny\, ugly
 \, unexpectedly moving\, and very much alive…"\n.\nThe production is a d
 ark comedy and has an avant-garde\, 1970s sci-fi feel. From [their website
 ](https://axiscompany.org/mainstage.php)\, SPECIMEN "...draws from the tra
 dition of downtown experimental and absurdist theatre\, blending visual st
 orytelling\, heightened performance\, dark humor\, and immersive design...
 "\n.\nTickets are usually $40\, so this is a big discount to see a new\, w
 ell-reviewed show.\n.\n**The Details**\nAxis Theatre Company\n1 Sheridan S
 quare\, Greenwich Village\nNew York\, NY\n.\n**October 28 - November 21**\
 nSpecial Ticket Price: $10\nDiscount Code: SciFiBook\n.\n**Purchase your t
 ickets for this event via the [Axis Theater Company website](https://axisc
 ompany.org/mainstage.php)\, your rsvp to this Meetup event is not enough.*
 * Get your tickets asap\, this event will sell out!\n.\nWe'll be there on 
 Saturday\, November 7th\, and hope you can join us. But don't worry if you
  can't make that date\, the discount is available for all 16 performances!
  So choose the date that works best for you.\n.\nThanks again to the SPECI
 MEN team and the Axis Theater Company for inviting us to this event!\n.\nJ
 on & Meghan
